  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Indonesia in Developing a National Circular Economy Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is to conduct an analysis of economic, environmental and social potential of introducing Circular Economy in vital growth sectors of the Indonesian economy, including its impact on economic growth, job creation, natural resources and greenhouse gas emissions.</narrative>
